  "description": "HISPII crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H188 N8 O12 Sm4,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1F (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1K (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1M (Sm) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.903-4.186 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.41-112.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C172H220N8O12Sm4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
